This lab assignment exposes you to designing a dimensional model (DM) regardless of the industry. 
Complete each of the steps. Your working document may be any file type you prefer, but your final product should be a PDF. Name your file “YouName_LAB1” and turn it in to Canvas.
1.	Visit any store or restaurant and make a purchase.
2.	Obtain a retail transaction receipt dated within this module’s timeframe.
3.	Write your name on the receipt, then scan or photograph it and attach the image to your working document.
4.	In your working document:
a.	List each item from your receipt.
b.	Demonstrate how each item would fit into a fact table or a dimension table.
5.	Create a star schema diagram to illustrate your data model.
6.	Create a snowflake schema diagram showing the same data model in a normalized form.

